rem === java.util.ArrayList Creation and Iteration ===
rem Demonstrates: Creating an ArrayList, adding items, iterating with a for loop
rem Expected output:
rem   first
rem   second
rem   third

use java.util.ArrayList

list! = new ArrayList()
list!.add("first")
list!.add("second")
list!.add("third")

for i = 0 to list!.size() - 1
    print list!.get(i)
next i

release
